docs {
  Fetch multiple transactions by digest in a single call.

  **Service:** `sui.rpc.v2.LedgerService` · **Method:** `BatchGetTransactions` (unary)

  **Request fields:**
  - `digests` (repeated string): the transaction digests to fetch.
  - `read_mask` (optional FieldMask): applied to every result. Defaults to
    `digest` if omitted.

  **Response:** `transactions` (repeated `GetTransactionResult`) — each
  entry is either the `ExecutedTransaction` or a `google.rpc.Status`
  error, so one missing digest doesn't fail the whole batch.

  Replace the digest with a real one (e.g. from `GetCheckpoint`).

  Verified against `sui-mainnet.g.alchemy.com`.
}
